Type: Project
Package: fomcbeliefnetworks
Title: Minimum Spanning Tree Networks of Kalshi FOMC Meeting Prices
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: person("Bhavana", "Kannan", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads Kalshi Fed-decision prices, builds a daily expected
    policy move per FOMC meeting, and compares minimum spanning trees of
    meeting correlations before and after the September 2026 hike.
